## 2026-08-16 — Monthly dependency vulnerability audit

- Ran `npm audit --audit-level=high` during session startup.
- Findings: 5 moderate vulnerabilities in the transitive `uuid` dependency chain used by `@google/clasp`; no high or critical vulnerabilities reported.
- Remediation: not applied because `npm audit fix --force` would introduce a breaking `@google/clasp` downgrade. Revisit with an intentional dependency update task.

